          "summary": "Give the Company a 30-day convenience termination right without penalty; limit HDI to end-of-term non-renewal on 90 days' notice; remove the Net Sales-based Termination Payment.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We have added a Company right to terminate for convenience on 30 days' notice without penalty and limited HDI to non-renewal at the end of a term on 90 days' notice, so HDI cannot walk away mid-term. We have also deleted the Termination Payment, which is an uncapped exit penalty (50% of annual Net Sales over $800,000) payable only by us; if HDI needs some exit compensation, we can discuss a cap of no more than three months' fees.",
