              "paragraphId": "p0024",
              "oldText": "unless terminated by either Party hereto upon ninety (90) days written notice to the other. Such notice shall specify the date on which this Agreement is to be terminated (the \"Termination Date\").",
              "newText": "unless (a) the Company terminates this Agreement for convenience, in whole or in part, upon thirty (30) days' prior written notice to HDI, in which case HDI shall refund any prepaid fees for the period after the effective date of termination, or (b) HDI elects not to renew this Agreement effective at the end of the then-current term upon ninety (90) days' prior written notice to the Company. HDI shall have no right to terminate this Agreement for convenience during any term. Such notice shall specify the date on which this Agreement is to be terminated (the \"Termination Date\")."
